## 🧠 About

**Life-OS** is an AI-powered digital wellbeing dashboard built with Streamlit and Google Gemini.

It analyzes screen-time behavior and transforms raw usage data into actionable lifestyle recommendations.

Instead of simply telling users to "use their phone less", Life-OS identifies major digital distractions and recommends real-world alternatives such as exercise, reading, cooking, outdoor activities, journaling, and focused work.

## ✨ Features

- 📊 14-day screen-time analytics
- 📱 App and category usage tracking
- 🎯 Custom daily screen-time goals
- 📈 Interactive screen-time trend visualization
- 🧮 Real-time KPI dashboard
- 🧠 Gemini-powered AI Life Coach
- ⚠️ Screen-time severity detection
- 🏃 Real-world activity recommendations
- 🔗 Shareable Accountability Links
- 🌙 Professional SaaS-style dark interface

## 🤖 AI Life Coach

Life-OS summarizes daily screen-time data and sends the aggregated information to Gemini.

The AI evaluates:

- Productive vs distracting screen time
- Biggest digital time leaks
- Goal performance
- Opportunities to reclaim time
- Physical and real-world replacement activities
- A practical challenge for the next day

## 🔗 Accountability Mode

Life-OS uses Streamlit's `st.query_params` to encode the selected date and screen-time statistics into the URL.

This allows users to share their screen-time results with an accountability partner.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

```text
Frontend / Dashboard  → Streamlit
Data Processing       → Pandas
AI                    → Google Gemini
Gemini SDK            → google-genai
Dataset               → CSV
Configuration         → python-dotenv
```

