## ⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL
cd Life-OS-Wellbeing-Dashboard
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create a `.env` file:

```text
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```

Run Life-OS:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## 🔐 Security

API credentials are never committed to the repository.

Local development uses `.env`, while deployed environments use Streamlit Secrets.

## 📊 Dataset

The project uses a synthetic 14-day digital wellbeing dataset containing:

```text
Date
App_Name
Category
Minutes_Used
```

This simulates real-world screen-time information without requiring access to restricted device wellbeing APIs.

## 🚀 Deployment

The application can be deployed using Streamlit Community Cloud.

The Gemini API key must be configured through Streamlit Secrets:

```toml
GEMINI_API_KEY = "your_api_key_here"
```

